# Final System - Tar
# Build and install under chroot

# Per LFS: First fix the package to 
# build with acl-2.4.0:
patch -Np1 -i ../patches/tar-ml.lfs/tar-1.35-acl_fix-1.patch

# Prepare tar for 64-bit compilation:
FORCE_UNSAFE_CONFIGURE=1 \
./configure --prefix=/usr

# Compile the package:
make 

# To test the results, issue: 
make check

# NOTE: Per LFS, One test, capabilities: binary store/restore, 
# is known to fail if it is run because LFS lacks selinux, 
# but will be skipped if the host kernel does not support 
# extended attributes or security labels on the filesystem 
# used for building LFS. 

# Install the package: 
make install

